  "body": "**Remove the unreachable Machine-door code**\n\nAfter the workspace tab strip landed in the ribbon, the Machine door\n(`Cmd::Machine`, its dropdown, `ribbon_mode_open` and the mode door rows in\n`panes.rs`) lost its call sites: the SETUP group holds no `Machine` cell and\n`follow_gate` routes the refused-Create gate to the active setup's Machine\npage instead of opening the door. The door code still compiles but no UI\npath reaches it.\n\nRemove:\n\n- `Cmd::Machine` and its arms (`text_of`, `icon_of`, `toggled`, `run_cmd`,\n  `tip_of`),\n- the machine-door dropdown rendering in `panes.rs`,\n- `type_of(Cmd::Machine)`, `machine_menu_width`, `DROP_W`, the\n  `machine_rows` helpers whose only callers were the door,\n- door tests in `machine_mode_tests.rs` that pin the door specifically\n  (keeping the mode table tests for the tab strip),\n- `ribbon_mode_open` and `ribbon_recent_open` where nothing sets them.\n\nDepends on the workbench rework being merged.\n",
